## BallerApp

- **App**: court discovery, ranked games, tournaments
- **Status**: v2 restart — `baller_app/` + `backend/` (FastAPI) in-repo; `api/` (Hono) target (ADR-0012)
- **Mobile (target)**: Flutter · Maps · geolocator
- **Backend (target)**: Hono + TypeScript + Drizzle + PostGIS on Hetzner
- **Auth (target)**: Custom JWT + Resend email verification
- **Storage**: **Backblaze B2** presigned uploads only
- **Design**: `design/DESIGN.md` · `design/baller-design-knowledge.md` · `.cursor/project/design-pipeline.md`
- **Docs (SSOT)**: `docs/` · deploy: `docs/deploy/server.md` · scripts: `docs/scripts/README.md`
- **CI**: `.github/workflows/pr-quality.yaml` (`peakoss/anti-slop@v0`)

